    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[流星记]]></title>
      <description><![CDATA[记于与流星友人告别之际。珍惜星星友人，珍重，流星友人。]]></description>
      <link>https://www.milo.me/zh/blogs/meteor-record</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.milo.me/zh/blogs/meteor-record</guid>
      <category><![CDATA[随笔]]></category>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[Milo]]></dc:creator>
      <pubDate>Sat, 11 Jan 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[生命中有些人如同这火流星，短暂来到你的身边，从你的视线边缘划过，迅速贴近，发出巨量光芒，便匆匆离开。]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
